<Figure id="d-contrib-crate-layers">
<svg viewBox="0 0 760 422" role="img" aria-label="The workspace's crates in dependency layers: the binaries and tools on top, then calimero-node, the wasmtime engine, the client and app build crates, services such as the sealed transport, search, outbound and the KMS client, and at the bottom crates with no workspace dependency such as primitives, identity, the Raft log, bundles and attestation. The SDK crates are compiled into apps, not linked by the node." xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg">
  <rect x="0" y="0" width="760" height="422" rx="10" fill="#0f0f16"/>
  <text x="380" y="26" text-anchor="middle" fill="#c9d1d9" font-family="'JetBrains Mono', monospace" font-size="11" font-weight="700">the workspace in dependency layers</text>
  <g class="seq-step" style="--step-i:0">
    <rect x="12" y="44" width="736" height="44" rx="6" fill="#161b22" stroke="#30363d"/>
    <text x="22" y="63" fill="#c9d1d9" font-family="'JetBrains Mono', monospace" font-size="9.5" font-weight="700">binaries · tools</text>
    <text x="22" y="76" fill="#8b949e" font-family="'JetBrains Mono', monospace" font-size="8">what you run</text>
    <rect x="150" y="52" width="56" height="22" rx="4" fill="#231708" stroke="#f0883e"/>
